                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>Loading time metrics:</run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#333333'>Currently we are only tracking the Webview Start to Interactive (</run>
                        <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333'>WSTI</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#333333'>), which is defined as the time it takes from the moment a browser/web-view requests the web page until the first route’s main content is ready to accept interactivity. </run>
                        <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                        <run fontcolor='#333333'>WSTI is measured in milliseconds.</run>
                      </formatted-text>
